      "codexName": "canopy_delete_watchers",
      "description": "Delete 1–20 watchers this delegated task created. Use watcher ids returned by SearchWatchers, SetupWatchers, WatchGitHubItems, WatchCommand, or ScheduleWakeup. Results are reported per id as deleted, not_found, or busy; watchers created by the user, the parent chat, or another delegated task are never deletable through this tool and are reported as not_found. Canopy captures the recipient and ownership server-side; pass only watcherIds.",
